# Local agent-host adapters. Not repository content.
#
# `.agents/skills` is a Windows junction to `.ai/skills`, created locally so
# that DSH can discover the canonical skills through its rank-200 project root.
# `.ai/skills` is not a discovery root by itself.
#
# Git does NOT track a junction as a link: it walks through it and indexes one
# real file per skill. Committing `.agents/` would therefore duplicate the
# canonical skill content into the repository — the exact duplication the
# architecture forbids. A committed symlink is not an alternative either: on a
# Windows clone with `core.symlinks=false` it materializes as a plain text file
# and the host skips the root silently.
#
# The junction is a local deployment detail. A fresh clone must recreate it.
/.agents/
